/- File: HolMultiLib/Homology.lean

  Original (c) Copyright, John Harrison 2018-2020
  Lean4 translation by Chris Walton 2026

  A translation of HOL Light's `Multivariate/homology.ml`, in the style of
  HolMultiLib/Metric.lean and HolMultiLib/Topology.lean: pure, the proofs
  translated by hand, one `let` per OCaml `let`, in file order.  What
  homology.ml uses from the core library, from Library/frag.ml,
  grouptheory.ml, card.ml and iter.ml, and from Multivariate/misc.ml and
  metric.ml is passed in `HomologyDeps`; SessionMultiLib/Homology.lean
  supplies it.
-/

